  "implemented": [
    "Strict remove inspection/recovery/outcome DTO and bounded independent recovery list. Unknown fields and contradictory permissions rejected.",
    "First explicit preparation only exports and verifies recovery; no worktree_start or deletion dispatch. A separate fresh checkbox and type=button confirm bind exact owner, operation, archive revision and verified recovery digests.",
    "Status may advance only original living owner; timeout, cancellation, close, cold/reopen, mismatched receipts never acquire deletion permission. Exact maintenance inactive receipt releases only own lease.",
    "Recovery remains reachable after cancellation or deletion; no Use/forget/cache cleanup rights. Verified removal prunes only exact archive.",
    "Presentation deduplicates equal blocker reasons, restore occupied path is contextual, restored result does not claim draft was unused."
  ],
